1 m per unit (world frame, clipped to the mocap bounds in\n  spec) and the hand follows; the wrist is fixed. grip > 0 closes, < 0 opens. Each control runs\n  5 physics steps of 2.5 ms (80 Hz). Requests are validated strictly and rejected (HTTP 400),\n  never\n\n… 457 characters not shown …\n\nion and control code.\n\n`observe()` also saves the RGB image as /app/output/limited-view-<camera>.jpg. Use your native\nview_image tool to open that file after observing. Images are not attached to your turns\nautomatically, and a saved image is only as recent as the last observe() of that camera.\n\nOne continuous episode: at most 500 controls and 3600 seconds from activation. Observing,\nthinking, coding and controlling all consume this wall budget. When status().ended is true,\nstop sending controls and finish your response immediately. Protected evidence is sealed\nautomatically after you stop; your own trajectory or reward files are not used for scoring.\n/app\n/app/limited_client.py\n/app/API.md\n","n":2957,"te":2.6},{"k":"run","t":6.5,"tool":"exec","cmd":"python - <<'PY'\nimport limited_client as robot\nprint(robot.spec())\nprint(robot.status())\no=robot.observe('corner')\nprint({k:v for k,v in o.items() if k not in ('rgb','depth_m','intrinsic','camera_to_world')})\nPY","status":"ok","wall":1.0,"out":"{'action_lower': [-1.0, -1.0, -1.0, -1.0], 'action_scale_m': 0.01, 'action_semantics': '[dx, dy, dz, grip]: mocap XYZ displacement = clip(a,-1,1)*0.01 m per control (world frame, target clipped to mocap bounds); grip +1 closes, -1 opens', 'action_shape': [4], 'action_upper': [1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0], 'agent_seconds': 3600.0, 'cameras': ['topview', 'corner', 'corner2', 'corner3', 'corner4', 'behindGripper', 'gripperPOV'], 'control_hz': 80.0, 'height': 480, 'max_actions': 500, 'mocap_lower': [-0.5, 0.4, 0.05], 'mocap_upper': [0.5, 1.0, 0.5], 'physics_steps_per_control': 5, 'physics_timestep': 0.0025, 'protocol': 'metaworldplus-limited-v1', 'width': 480, 'world_frame': 'MuJoCo wo